  "summary": "In C5 the threshold for each target day-of-year (152-243 by tm_yday, Mar 1 of non-leap years mapping to 60) is the 31-day wrapped mean of raw day-of-year thresholds 137-258, each a Hazen 90th percentile pooled over all region cells' baseline values on that exact day-of-year (no \u00b15-day window). Every sea cell's 2021-06-01..2021-08-31 SST is then compared to it and run/gap logic writes the mask saved to output/mhw_mask.nc. Baseline dates reaching the mask are May 16-Sep 14 in leap years and May 17-Sep 15 in non-leap years."
